2.0% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $31.4m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $1.4m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 143.4% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-24.0% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $2.8m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 9.7% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784254/000178425426000025/0001784254-26-000025-index.htm","accession":"0001784254-26-000025